  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons capable of Autofire except Pistols</p>\n<p><em>“If you fill every square inch with bullets, you technically can’t miss.”</em></p>\n<p>Only one Gatling Barrel may be installed. The weapon is now Two-Handed if not already so and expends twice the amount of ammunition it normally would when using Autofire/Suppressive Fire. When making an Autofire Attack with the weapon, if the Attack Check DV is only beat by 1, the attack still uses a (x2) multiplier. If the weapon already had this perk, then the minimum multiplier it can have is increased by 1, to a maximum of Autofire (3). Additionally, when using suppressive Fire with the weapon, anyone making a Check to resist it now suffers a -2 penalty to do so. Incompatible with Telescopic Barrel.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Barrels &amp; Muzzles).</em></p>"
